@@ -249,6 +249,7 @@ Every `test_*.py` file is listed below, with the reason the module exists rather
 | [`test_host_endpoint_service.py`](test_host_endpoint_service.py) | Managed endpoints through create, status, request, and close. Re-pointing an existing local registration at a new port needs approval, the free-port scan closes every socket it opens, and the projection carries no secrets. |
 | [`test_host_llm_service.py`](test_host_llm_service.py) | In-kernel `host.llm`. A batch preserves order and bounds the concurrency it was asked for, and a failed item stays a hard failure rather than being softened into an empty reply. |
 | [`test_host_mcp_service.py`](test_host_mcp_service.py) | MCP on the Host: connector lookup by ID then exact name, tool discovery and call routing, resource and prompt reads, and the soft-error contract each of them uses. A disabled connector is refused at every entry point, not only in the listing. |
+| [`test_host_openmhs.py`](test_host_openmhs.py) | Optional OpenMHS routing: original transport, fail-closed adapter absence, connector/child restrictions, narrow trusted-stop approval exception, audit and output screening, and import-hook behavior without the external SDK. Uses stubbed adapters. |
 | [`test_host_progress_service.py`](test_host_progress_service.py) | Session todos and progress against an approved plan. The plan mutation is committed before the event sink runs, and a failing sink is best-effort — it cannot undo a step that already ticked. |
 | [`test_host_remote_capability_service.py`](test_host_remote_capability_service.py) | Remote capability probes. Validation soft-fails before SSH is ever started, a transport failure never writes the registry, and the registry is updated only after a probe actually succeeds. |
 | [`test_host_remote_science_service.py`](test_host_remote_science_service.py) | Remote folding and mutation scoring, where the no-fabrication policy is the whole point. An incomplete or unparseable remote result produces an exact diagnostic, never a plausible-looking number. Provenance is parsed on a best-effort basis and drained by identity. |
